# Plugin marketplace clones (populated by `claude plugin marketplace add` — upstream-managed; do NOT re-vendor per cardinal-rule-12)
.claude/plugins/marketplaces/

# Plugin runtime data (per-plugin venvs, daemon state, cached requirements — auto-generated per plugin convention; W280-closeout 2026-05-17)
